Z||000001||rogergarrison||02-09-2001||12:11 PM||||seems like your going to get rid of one anyway in the end. Id save up for either the V8 or the 88, whichever you want first. rig the other one and drive it till it dies, your gonna throw it away anyhow. Im not clear sure but I think a new rebuild on the 88 would be cheaper than the V8 though, lots less work to do in a hurry too. So if your a little tite rite now save the V8 till last.||||reg||1
Z||000002||ThatRickGuy||02-09-2001||01:48 PM||||I'd say keep your 88 as a daily driver. Stock, the suspention and handling is better then the pre 88s, but with an investment you can upgrade the pre to be just as good/better and maintainable at a cheeper price (88 parts are expencive!) That way, you can save up some more cash and just get the whole deal for your 87. but that's just my view.||||reg||1
